	--smasher

	--under root is AdamSmasherBoss.ParryMeleeAttack01CounterDefinition cond with AdamSmasherBoss.ParryMeleeAttack01CounterDefinition but it doesnt really do anything




	--stage 1 transition AdamSmasherBoss.SE_SmashedStage1 condition AdamSmasherBoss.SE_SmashedStage1Condition
	--AdamSmasherBoss.SmasherOwnerParryCounterCondition is when parry count is 2, causes AdamSmasherBoss.ParryStaggerBack. After reset parry count is AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackAutoShotgunOnPlace or if AdamSmasherBoss.JumpAttackConditionDistanceParried condition met he will do AdamSmasherBoss.JumpAttackSequence or AdamSmasherBoss.JumpAttackSprintSequence, followed by AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackAutoShotgunOnPlace
	--If parried once AdamSmasherBoss.SmasherOwnerParryCounterSoftCondition, then AdamSmasherBoss.ParryStaggerBack

	--does AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackAutoShotgunOnPlace when he has AdamSmasherBoss.AIShootCommand cond
	--if he has AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackAutoShotgunConditionPath, then AdamSmasherBoss.StrafeAroundTargetAutoShotgun or AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackAutoShotgunNoPathSelector
	--if AdamSmasherBoss.TauntShotgun01KnockedDown, AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackCannonKnockdownAcquiringTimer or AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackCannonKnockdownAcquiringTimer followed by AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackCannonKnockdown followed by AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackCannonLoop. Another variation is AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackAutoShotgunOnPlaceMalfunction or AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackAutoShotgunOnPlace


	--After knockdown stuff -> AdamSmasherBoss.SE_Stage1_aCondition which is if plate not destroyed. Selector tree node: First is AdamSmasherBoss.LocomotionMalfunctionCondition, next is AdamSmasherBoss.JumpAttackCondition and AdamSmasherBoss.NotCyberwareMalfunctionCondition which lead to AdamSmasherBoss.JumpAttackSequence(cond AdamSmasherBoss.JumpAttackConditionDistance) or AdamSmasherBoss.JumpAttackSprintSequence(AdamSmasherBoss.JumpAttackSprintConditionDistance). After that if AdamSmasherBoss.TauntShotgun01KnockedDown, then AdamSmasherBoss.TauntShotgun01KnockedDown and running in parallel is cond AdamSmasherBoss.CheckHitKerenzikovActivation and dodge signal
	--Next is AdamSmasherBoss.MadnessPatternCondition, first AdamSmasherBoss.ReloadAutoShotgun then AdamSmasherBoss.WalkToTargetAutoShotgun and AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackAutoShotgunMadness
	--Next is 2 OR conditions AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackAutoShotgunConditions/AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackAutoShotgunConditionPath. Leads to a selector. First is AdamSmasherBoss.StrafeAroundTargetAutoShotgun+AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackAutoShotgunNoPathSelector(AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackAutoShotgunConditionPath). 2nd is AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackAutoShotgunOnPlaceSelector(AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackAutoShotgunOnPlace). 3rd is AdamSmasherBoss.WalkToTargetAutoShotgun+AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackAutoShotgunMovingSelector
	--Next is AdamSmasherBoss.MeleeComboCondition. First is AdamSmasherBoss.DashForwardToTarget(AdamSmasherBoss.MeleeComboCloseSequenceCondition) or AdamSmasherBoss.SprintToTargetMelee with in parallel (AdamSmasherBoss.CheckHitKerenzikovActivation). Followed by Variation 1 AdamSmasherBoss.MeleeCombo02P1 and AdamSmasherBoss.MeleeCombo02P2 and AdamSmasherBoss.MeleeCombo02P3 and ending with parallel AdamSmasherBoss.MeleeCombo02P3Recovery or AdamSmasherBoss.CheckHitKerenzikovBulletActivation. Variation 2 AdamSmasherBoss.MeleeCombo01P1 AdamSmasherBoss.MeleeCombo01P2 AdamSmasherBoss.MeleeCombo01P2Recovery parallel with AdamSmasherBoss.CheckHitKerenzikovBulletActivation

	--if AdamSmasherBoss.SE_Stage1_aCondition stuff not used then cond AdamSmasherBoss.JumpAttackCondition+AdamSmasherBoss.NotCyberwareMalfunctionCondition: 1st is AdamSmasherBoss.JumpAttackSequence(AdamSmasherBoss.JumpAttackConditionDistance) or cond AdamSmasherBoss.JumpAttackSprintConditionDistance which uses sandy startup and without jump sequence. That sequence starts with AdamSmasherBoss.SandevistanStartup01 then AdamSmasherBoss.SprintToTargetJumpSandevistan parallel with AdamSmasherBoss.EdgerunnerSandevistanfxLow02, then AdamSmasherBoss.JumpAttackSprintFinal AdamSmasherBoss.SetJumpAttackCooldown. Followed by aimcannonknockdownstuff+AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackCannonLoop(AdamSmasherBoss.TauntShotgun01KnockedDown), then AdamSmasherBoss.CheckHitKerenzikovActivation
	--If jumpsequence above not used then AdamSmasherBoss.MadnessPatternCondition and madness stuff
	--3rd option is AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackAutoShotgunSplashConditions, very complicated teleport
	--4th option is AdamSmasherBoss.MeleeComboCondition, 3 diff melee combo variants

	--AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackCannonLoop requires AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackCannon for the arm to be raised


	--start of phase 2, equip AdamSmasherBoss.EquipProjectileLauncherInstantly_inline4 and AdamSmasherBoss.EquipProjectileLauncherRunInstantly_inline2
	--after initial actions, if AdamSmasherBoss.EmergencyStateCondition then base\gameplay\ai\behaviors\combat\bosses\adam_smasher_combat_hmg_missile_rain.behavior
	--if AdamSmasherBoss.MissileRetreatCondition which is targetbelow7m then find teleport position, teleport and AdamSmasherBoss.MissileRain01 AdamSmasherBoss.SetMissileRetreatCooldown
	--if not missile rain then AdamSmasherBoss.MeleeAttackHMGConditionDistance AdamSmasherBoss.MeleeAttackHMG
	--OR AdamSmasherBoss.JumpAttackHMGCondition usually sandy startup stuff then AdamSmasherBoss.JumpAttackSprintHMGFinal and if AdamSmasherBoss.TauntShotgun01KnockedDown then AdamSmasherBoss.TauntLMG01
	--OR AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackAutoShotgunSplashConditions. AdamSmasherBoss.EquipLeftArmLaserInstantly then sandystartup sprint stuff(AdamSmasherBoss.SprintToTargetSplashSandevistanFarCondition). Then teleport stuff, AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackHMGSplashAcquiringTimer AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackLMGSplashCoverStartup in parallel. then AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackLMGSplashCover AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackLMGSplashCoverRecovery. Then if AdamSmasherBoss.MeleeAttackHMGConditionDistance AdamSmasherBoss.MeleeAttackHMG
	--OR sandystartup+AdamSmasherBoss.SprintToTargetSplashSandevistan+AdamSmasherBoss.SprintToTargetSplashSandevistanOut(AdamSmasherBoss.SprintToTargetSplashSandevistan). Then parallel between AdamSmasherBoss.WalkToTargetHMG(AdamSmasherBoss.WalkToTargetHMGCondition) or rotatetotarget and AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackLMGMoving. Then AdamSmasherBoss.ReloadLMGEmergency

	--if not the above then base\gameplay\ai\behaviors\combat\bosses\adam_smasher_combat_emergency.behavior

	--missile rain behavior. if AdamSmasherBoss.MissileRainCondition and ReinforcementState = 0, set ReinforcementState to 1 then AdamSmasherBoss.CallWave01a then AdamSmasherBoss.FindMissileRainPosition, AdamSmasherBoss.SandevistanStartupMovementDetination then AdamSmasherBoss.SprintToMissileRainSpotNoInterrupt parallel with AdamSmasherBoss.EdgerunnerSandevistanfxLow03. AdamSmasherBoss.MissileRainSequence then AdamSmasherBoss.TauntLMG01 then AdamSmasherBoss.SetSpecialAttackHMGCooldown
	-- if AdamSmasherBoss.MissileRainCondition and ReinforcementState = 1 then set to 2 and call 1b. Same stuff but AdamSmasherBoss.FindMissileSpillPosition
	--After missileran stuff is AdamSmasherBoss.MeleeAttackHMGCondition AdamSmasherBoss.MeleeAttackHMGSequence


	--emergency behavior. AdamSmasherBoss.EquipHMGInstantly AdamSmasherBoss.EquipProjectileLauncherInstantly AdamSmasherBoss.EquipProjectileLauncherRunInstantly AdamSmasherBoss.EquipRainProjectileLauncherInstantly. Then AdamSmasherBoss.EquipLeftArmLaserInstantly
	--if AdamSmasherBoss.EmergencyStateInitialSequenceCondition then AdamSmasherBoss.LowerServer. If HasPerformedEmergency false then AdamSmasherBoss.SE_StaggeredEmergency and set to true. AdamSmasherBoss.SprintToTargetTeleportIn AdamSmasherBoss.FindFinalPosition and teleport. Then AdamSmasherBoss.MissileRainCenter, AdamSmasherBoss.SetSpecialAttackHMG01EmergencyCooldown, AdamSmasherBoss.TauntLMG01, AdamSmasherBoss.RemoveInvicibility. Or if not first time, then AdamSmasherBoss.SpecialAttackHMG01EmergencyCondition AdamSmasherBoss.FindFinalPosition teleport. if AdamSmasherBoss.SpecialAttackHMG01CwMalfunction then AdamSmasherBoss.SpecialAttackHMG01CwMalfunction else AdamSmasherBoss.SpecialAttackHMG01Emergency. AdamSmasherBoss.SetSpecialAttackHMG01EmergencyCooldown AdamSmasherBoss.TauntLMG01. Then teleport AdamSmasherBoss.SprintToTargetSplashSandevistan, AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackHMGSplashAcquiringTimer AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackLMGSplashEmergencyStartup and AdamSmasherBoss.AimAttackLMGSplashEmergency. Then AdamSmasherBoss.JumpAttackSprintHMGEmergencyFinal AdamSmasherBoss.ReloadLMGEmergency

	--add more to missile rain after AdamSmasherBoss.MissileRetreatCondition as well as MeleeAttackHMGConditionDistance and JumpAttackHMGCondition and AimAttackAutoShotgunSplashConditions and AimAttackLMGMoving
	--maybe add missile spill to AdamSmasherBoss.SprintToMissileRainSpotNoInterrupt
	--add more missile rain to missile rain center

	--after meleeattackhmg is AdamSmasherBoss.MeleeAttackEmergency
	--after jumpattack. First AdamSmasherBoss.EquipLeftArmLaserInstantly sandycharge lmgsplash + laser. Uses AdamSmasherBoss.EdgerunnerSandevistanfxLow03 and SmasherSandyEdgerunnerChargeToTargetComposite, SmasherAfterJumpLMGSplashComposite then SmasherShootLaserMovingAction. Followed by 3 sequences of SmasherLMGSplashAction+melee emergency+SmasherEdgerunnerSprintComposite
	--after aimsplash is melee charge. Uses AdamSmasherBoss.EdgerunnerSandevistanfxLow02 SmasherHMGSplashMelee1Composite SmasherMissileSpillLMGAction. Then parallel SmasherEdgerunnerSprintComposite edgerunnervfx, 3 sequences of teleport and meleeattack. Has AdamSmasherBoss.MeleeAttackEmergency for MeleeAttackHMGConditionDistance
	--after lmgmoving is sandycharge then emergencyattack1 then parallel edgerunnervfx+SmasherAfterLMGMoveComposite then 3 sequences of SmasherLMGSplashAction+melee emergency+SmasherEdgerunnerSprintComposite

	--SmasherMissileRain1Action and 2 after missile rain centre

