	--documenting the behavior, combat melee patterns
	--powerful attack
	--selector1: Starts with (KurtSandyChargeCooldownConditionAction), sequence of KurtCombatTaunt3Action as monitortask+sprint+monitor task KurtSandyChargeComposite+instant cond KurtMeleeCombatStimAction+kkurt_krauser_combat_melee_dash_routine. 2nd is (kurtMeleeComboVariation=1), sequence of sprint+monitor task KurtCustomMeleeVariation1Composite +heal and dodge. 3rd is (kurtMeleeComboVariation=0), similar things but KurtCustomMeleeVariation2Composite
	--selector2 combattaunts: KurtCombatTaunt0CooldownConditionAction, KurtCombatTaunt1CooldownConditionAction, KurtCombatTaunt2CooldownConditionAction
	--selector3 strng combo: Starts with (kurtStrongMeleeComboVariation=0), sprint+KurtCustomMeleeVariation3Composite+heal_dodge. Next is KurtCustomMeleeVariation4Composite
	--selector4: KurtSupportTaunt0CooldownConditionAction, KurtSupportTaunt1CooldownConditionAction
	--selector5 generic combo: start with (kurtGenericMeleeComboVariation=0), KurtCustomMeleeVariation5Composite. Or KurtCustomMeleeVariation6Composite. Or instant cond (KurtChargeJumpCooldownConditionAction) for KurtCustomMeleeVariation7Composite
	--selector8: KurtKerezActivationTauntCooldownConditionAction
	--selector9: kurtKnifeThrowVariation=0 is sequence of set arg, KurtKnifeThrowStartCooldownAction, KurtKrauserBoss.RotateToTarget, KurtKrauserBoss.UnequipWeaponRight, KurtFastKnifeThrowAction, KurtKrauserBoss.EquipMeleeWeaponInstantly(has to be instant otherwise smoke nade after this can be glitched). kurtKnifeThrowVariation=1 is sequence of set arg, KurtKnifeThrowStartCooldownAction, KurtKrauserBoss.RotateToTarget, KurtKrauserBoss.UnequipWeaponRight, KurtFastKnifeThrowAction, if knifehit then takedown stuff from other behavior, KurtKrauserBoss.EquipMeleeWeaponInstantly
	--dodge tree
	--instant cond (KurtCombo1TakedownCooldownConditionAction). Sequence: sequence with monitor task KurtTeleportSmokeNadeAction then instant cond KurtTeleportApplyBlindAction. Teleport monitor task, teleport. Parallel of monitor task KurtPostTeleportComposite1 and monitor task KurtTakedownRedEyesAction

	--default attack
	--after dodge subtree, there is knife throw sequence. KurtKrauserBoss.RotateToTarget and usual knife throw sequence








