	--behavior details ribakov

	--phase1
	--RibakovPhasePosition=0. Select shootposition, immunity, camo, sprint, remove immun, decamo, shootsniper but without reload, set RibakovPhasePosition=1
	--RibakovPhasePosition=1. find overheatspot, immune, parallel of vanish and sequence of waitsec waithalfsec teleport. remove immune, selector depending on RibakovQuickhackVariation(0 is RibakovQuickhackBurnAction, 1 is overload, 2 is melt. For each quickhack monitortask there is child instanttask to set RibakovQuickhackVariation), RibakovPhasePosition=2
	--RibakovPhasePosition=2. Select shootposition, immunity, camo, sprint, remove immun, decamo, composite RibakovPhase1SniperVar1Composite, RibakovPhasePosition=3
	--RibakovPhasePosition=3. find relocatescaffold, immune, parallel of vanish and sequence of waitsec waithalfsec teleport. remove immune, RibakovPhase1SniperVar2Composite, RibakovPhasePosition=4. Somehow camo is active during the composite
	--RibakovPhasePosition=4. fIND relocateground, immune, parallel of vanish and sequence of waitsec waithalfsec teleport. remove immune, selector depending on RibakovQuickhackVariation, RibakovPhasePosition=5
	--RibakovPhasePosition=5. find overheat scaffold, immunity, camo, sprint, remove immun, decamo, composite RibakovPhase1SniperVar1Composite, RibakovPhasePosition=0
	--for all of them there is instantcond with pushattack at start of sequence

	--phase 2
	--replace sprinttotarget before behavior file with OdaBoss.SprintToTargetDashSandevistan
	--then in sequence before sts_ep1_08_holo_preparation, add a parallel node containing default weapon handling as right node and repeat nodes for movepolicy and strafepolicy
	--in sts_ep1_08_holo_preparation sequence, add quickhack sequence but with sprint instead of vanish


	--phase 3
	--for RibakovPhase3InitActions=0 condition, added instanttask at end to reset quickhackvariation to 0 for phase 3 quickhacks, also reset RibakovPhasePosition to 0 for later sequences
	--remove default hacking stuff
	--add selector with 3 sequences based on RibakovPhasePosition
	--RibakovPhasePosition=0. Hacking sequence with selector of RibakovQuickhackDeathAction first or melt
	--RibakovPhasePosition=1. Sprint to RibakovBoss.FindShootPositionGround, RibakovSMGPhase3Var1Composite
	--RibakovPhasePosition=2. Vanish, RibakovSMGPhase3Var2Part1Composite


