	--powerful attack
	--selector 0: sprint to target
	--selector1: if kurtMeleeComboVariation 0 and if KurtKrauserBoss.TakedownCondition then KurtKrauserBoss.MeleeLightCombo01_TakedownDefinition. else KurtKrauserBoss.MeleeLightCombo01Definition. if kurtMeleeComboVariation 1. if KurtKrauserBoss.TakedownCondition then KurtKrauserBoss.MeleeLightCombo02_TakedownDefinition. else KurtKrauserBoss.MeleeLightCombo02Definition
	--selector2 combattaunts: KurtCombatTaunt0CooldownConditionAction, KurtCombatTaunt1CooldownConditionAction, KurtCombatTaunt2CooldownConditionAction
	--selector3 strng combo: Starts with (kurtStrongMeleeComboVariation=0), sprint+KurtCustomMeleeVariation3Composite+heal_dodge. Next is KurtCustomMeleeVariation4Composite
	--selector4: KurtSupportTaunt0CooldownConditionAction, KurtSupportTaunt1CooldownConditionAction
	--selector5 generic combo: start with (kurtGenericMeleeComboVariation=0), KurtCustomMeleeVariation5Composite. Or KurtCustomMeleeVariation6Composite. Or instant cond (KurtChargeJumpCooldownConditionAction) for KurtCustomMeleeVariation7Composite
	--selector8: KurtKerezActivationTauntCooldownConditionAction
	--selector9: kurtKnifeThrowVariation=0 is sequence of set arg, KurtKnifeThrowStartCooldownAction, KurtKrauserBoss.RotateToTarget, KurtKrauserBoss.UnequipWeaponRight, KurtFastKnifeThrowAction, KurtKrauserBoss.EquipMeleeWeaponInstantly(has to be instant otherwise smoke nade after this can be glitched). kurtKnifeThrowVariation=1 is sequence of set arg, KurtKnifeThrowStartCooldownAction, KurtKrauserBoss.RotateToTarget, KurtKrauserBoss.UnequipWeaponRight, KurtFastKnifeThrowAction, if knifehit then takedown stuff from other behavior, KurtKrauserBoss.EquipMeleeWeaponInstantly
	--dodge tree
	--instant cond (KurtCombo1TakedownCooldownConditionAction). Sequence: sequence with monitor task KurtTeleportSmokeNadeAction then instant cond KurtTeleportApplyBlindAction. Teleport monitor task, teleport. Parallel of monitor task KurtPostTeleportComposite1 and monitor task KurtTakedownRedEyesAction

	--default attack
	--after dodge subtree, there is knife throw sequence. KurtKrauserBoss.RotateToTarget and usual knife throw sequence



	--new behavior, reworked the entire selector
	--1st is instantcond KurtKrauserBoss.HasNoMacheteCondition
	--2nd is kurtTeleportKnifeThrown=1 and instantcond KurtTeleportAttackCooldownConditionAction. Contains sequence of monitor task KurtTeleportAttackStartCooldownAction, monitor task KurtTeleportSmokeNadeAction then instant cond KurtTeleportApplyBlindAction. Teleport monitor task, teleport. Parallel of monitor task KurtPostTeleportComposite1 and monitor task KurtTakedownRedEyesAction
	--3rd is instantcond KurtKrauserBoss.MeleeJumpAttackCooldownCondition
	--4th is instantcond KurtStrongAttackCooldownConditionAction. Contains sequence of monitortask KurtStrongAttackStartCooldownAction, instantcond KurtTauntCooldownConditionAction tauntselector which is shown below. Then locomotion selector that does not contain sandevistanactivation. Then kurtStrongMeleeComboVariation and corresponding KurtNewStrongVariation1Composite
	--5th is instantcond KurtKnifeThrowComboCooldownConditionAction. sequence of monitortask KurtKnifeThrowComboStartCooldownAction, then kurtKnifeThrowVariation=0 is sequence of set arg, KurtKnifeThrowStartCooldownAction, KurtKrauserBoss.RotateToTarget, KurtKrauserBoss.UnequipWeaponRight, KurtFastKnifeThrowAction, KurtKrauserBoss.EquipMeleeWeaponInstantly(has to be instant otherwise smoke nade after this can be glitched). kurtKnifeThrowVariation=1 is sequence of set arg, KurtKnifeThrowStartCooldownAction, KurtKrauserBoss.RotateToTarget, KurtKrauserBoss.UnequipWeaponRight, KurtFastKnifeThrowAction, if knifehit then takedown stuff from other behavior, KurtKrauserBoss.EquipMeleeWeaponInstantly. After that is kurt teleport takedown from the 2nd but the one here doesnt seem to work anymore
	--6th is instantcond KurtChargeAttackCooldownConditionAction. sequence of monitortask KurtChargeAttackStartCooldownAction, locomotion selector that contains KurtKrauserBoss.SandevistanStartup01. Then selector kurtChargeVariation. var 0 KurtNewChargeVariation1Composite, var 1 KurtNewChargeVariation2Composite
	--7th is instantcond KurtComboAttackCooldownConditionAction. sequence of monitortask KurtComboAttackStartCooldownAction, instantcond KurtMeleeCombatStimAction, instantcond KurtTauntCooldownConditionAction taunt selector, then locomotion selector without sandy activation, then selector kurtGenericMeleeComboVariation. var 0 KurtNewComboVariation1Composite, var 1 KurtNewComboVariation2Composite, var 2 KurtNewComboVariation3Composite, var 3 KurtNewComboVariation4Composite
