	--centaur behavior
	--under attack selector
	--1st instant cond RoyceExo.SpecialAttackConditionOutOfRange has monitortask RoyceExo.AimAttackSplashStraightSequence
	--2nd is a sequence. First is instantconds RoyceExo.WalkToTargetConditionNoStraightPath and RoyceExo.AimAttackSplashConditions for a sequence. In this sequence, parallel of fx and monitortask RoyceExo.AimAttackSplashRight then instantcond RoyceExo.AimAttackSplashConditionsNoCooldown for parallel RoyceExo.AimAttackSplashLeft, then instantcond RoyceExo.AimAttackSplashConditionsNoCooldown for parallel RoyceExo.AimAttackSplashRight, then monitortask RoyceExo.SetAimAttackSplashCooldown.
	--back to main sequence. 2nd is instantconds RoyceExo.AimAttackSplashStraightConditions and RoyceExo.AimAttackSplashConditionsCooldown which has parallel of RoyceExo.AimAttackSplashAcquiringTimer and RoyceExo.AimAttackSplashSequence
	--3rd in main sequence is instantcond RoyceExo.SprintToTargetLosCondition and RoyceExo.NotLocomotionMalfunctionCondition for sequence of monitortasks RoyceExo.SprintToTarget and RoyceExo.SingleMeleeAttackStrongSelector
	--3rd is a sequence. Start with parallel of move command and repeat node for selector RoyceExo.SingleMeleeAttackStrongSelector(RoyceExo.SingleMeleeAttackStrongCondition) or RoyceExo.AimAttackEnragedSequence(RoyceExo.EnragedCondition)(RoyceExo.AimAttackConditions) or RoyceExo.AimAttackSequence(RoyceExo.AimAttackConditions). After parallel is instantcond RoyceExo.SprintToTargetCondition for monitortasks RoyceExo.SprintToTarget RoyceExo.SingleMeleeAttackStrongSelector. Then parallel of locomotion stuff with attacks. Attack sequence contains instantcond RoyceExo.SingleMeleeAttackStrongCondition for RoyceExo.SingleMeleeAttackStrongSelector and instantcond RoyceExo.AimAttackConditions. This instantcond has selector, contains instantcond RoyceExo.EnragedCondition for RoyceExo.AimAttackEnragedSequence or RoyceExo.AimAttackSequence.
	--Another sequence, start with isntantcond RoyceExo.SingleMeleeAttackStrongCondition for RoyceExo.SingleMeleeAttackStrongSelector. 2nd is isntantconds RoyceExo.SpecialAttackCondition and RoyceExo.SpecialAttackConditionNoPath for RoyceExo.SpecialAttackSequence. 3rd instantcond RoyceExo.WalkToTargetConditionNoStraightPath and RoyceExo.AimAttackSplashConditions for same splashattacks RoyceExo.AimAttackSplashConditionsNoCooldown from above. 4th instantcond RoyceExo.SwipeAttackCondition for selector. 1st is instantcond RoyceExo.EnragedCondition with selector for SwipeVariation. var 0 if RoyceExo.PlayerToTheLeftCondition, RoyceExo.SwipeAttackTopSelector(RoyceExo.SwipeAttackSelectorCondition) or RoyceExo.SwipeAttackTop180Selector. Then another selector still within var 0 RoyceExo.SwipeAttackDownSelector2(RoyceExo.SwipeAttackSelectorCondition) or RoyceExo.SwipeAttackDownSelector2. 
	--For var 1, has selector starting with instantcond RoyceExo.SwipeAttackTopSelector2(RoyceExo.SwipeAttackSelectorCondition) or RoyceExo.SwipeAttackTop180Selector2. Then another selector starting with RoyceExo.SwipeAttackDownSelector(RoyceExo.SwipeAttackSelectorCondition) or RoyceExo.SwipeAttackDown180Selector
	--After enraged is another selector for SwipeVariation
	--At end of swipe selector is RoyceExo.SetSwipeAttackCooldown
	--At end of sequence is instantcond RoyceExo.CombatTauntCondition for RoyceExo.CombatTauntSequence

